 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 533275,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How far is it to your workplace (as the crow flies) if the blocks in the previous example measure 100 ft by 100 ft?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1,140 ft"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The distance from point <span data-math=\"\\left( {{x_1},{y_1}} \\right)\"></span> to point <span data-math=\"\\left( {{x_2},{y_2}} \\right)\"></span> is <span data-math=\"d = \\sqrt {{{\\left( {{x_2} - {x_1}} \\right)}^2} + {{\\left( {{y_2} - {y_1}} \\right)}^2}} \"></span>.</p>\n<p>You go 7 south and 9 blocks west, where each block is 100 feet.</p>\n<p>If (0,0) is where you end up, you are looking for the distance from (0,0) to (900, 700).</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"d = \\sqrt {{{\\left( {900 - 0} \\right)}^2} + {{\\left( {700 - 0} \\right)}^2}} \"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"d = \\sqrt {810,000 + 490,000} \"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"d = \\sqrt {1,300,000} \"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"d \\approx {\\text{ }}1,140\\ {\\text{}}\"></span> feet</p>\n<p>The distance is approximately 1,140 feet.</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
